            <title>2.3.2</title>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <h3>What's New in v2.3.2</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>Update banner only appears when a strictly newer build is available, and clears after install/dismiss.</li>
                    <li>Whisper retries without VAD when the first pass is empty but the mic picked up real audio.</li>
                    <li>Clearer empty-transcript messaging for short vs failed captures.</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
